<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>洁家家政 - 北京专业家庭保洁服务</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif; color: #2d3748; line-height: 1.7; background: #fff; }
        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

        /* Header */
        header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 72px; }
        .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a6fb5; }
        .logo-icon { width: 38px; height: 38px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a6fb5, #4ecdc4); border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 18px; }
        nav { display: flex; gap: 32px; }
        nav a { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: #4a5568; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transition: all 0.2s; }
        nav a:hover, nav a.active { color: #1a6fb5; border-bottom-color: #1a6fb5; }
        .header-cta { background: #1a6fb5; color: #fff; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.2s; }
        .header-cta:hover { background: #15588f; }

        /* Hero */
        .hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f4fd 0%, #f0fff0 100%); padding: 80px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .hero::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -20%; width: 600px; height: 600px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(78,205,196,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%; }
        .hero-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 60px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        .hero-text { flex: 1; }
        .hero-badge { display: inline-block; background: #e6f7f5; color: #1a6fb5; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; color: #1a202c; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero h1 span { color: #1a6fb5; }
        .hero p { font-size: 17px; color: #4a5568; max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
        .btn-primary { background: #1a6fb5; color: #fff; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.2s; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #15588f; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(26,111,181,0.3); }
        .btn-secondary { background: #fff; color: #1a6fb5; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 2px solid #1a6fb5; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background: #e8f4fd; }
        .hero-visual { flex: 0 0 400px; }
        .hero-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .hero-card-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
        .hero-card-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .hero-card-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px; }
        .hc-1 { background: #e6f7f5; }
        .hc-2 { background: #fef3e6; }
        .hc-3 { background: #e8f0fe; }
        .hc-4 { background: #fce8f0; }
        .hero-card-row div:last-child { flex: 1; }
        .hero-card-label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #2d3748; }
        .hero-card-sub { font-size: 12px; color: #718096; }
        .hero-check { color: #48bb78; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; }

        /* Stats */
        .stats { padding: 48px 0; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; text-align: center; }
        .stat-item h3 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a6fb5; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .stat-item p { font-size: 14px; color: #718096; }

        /* Services Preview */
        .section { padding: 80px 0; }
        .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
        .section-header h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a202c; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .section-header p { font-size: 16px; color: #718096; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
        .service-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; transition: all 0.3s; }
        .service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-color: #1a6fb5; }
        .service-icon { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .si-1 { background: #e6f7f5; }
        .si-2 { background: #e8f0fe; }
        .si-3 { background: #fef3e6; }
        .si-4 { background: #fce8f0; }
        .si-5 { background: #f0e6fe; }
        .si-6 { background: #e6fef7; }
        .service-card h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #1a202c; }
        .service-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #718096; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .service-price { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a6fb5; }
        .service-price span { font-size: 12px; color: #718096; font-weight: 400; }

        /* Why Choose Us */
        .why-section { background: #f7fafc; }
        .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
        .why-visual { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a6fb5, #4ecdc4); border-radius: 20px; height: 380px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .why-visual::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 200px; height: 200px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 50%; top: -50px; left: -50px; }
        .why-visual::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 150px; height: 150px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 50%; bottom: -30px; right: -30px; }
        .why-visual-text { color: #fff; text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        .why-visual-text .big-num { font-size: 64px; font-weight: 800; display: block; }
        .why-visual-text .sub { font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.9; }
        .why-list { list-style: none; }
        .why-list li { display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 0; align-items: flex-start; }
        .why-list .check { width: 28px; height: 28px; min-width: 28px; background: #e6f7f5; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #1a6fb5; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 2px; }
        .why-list h4 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a202c; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .why-list p { font-size: 14px; color: #718096; }

        /* Testimonials */
        .testimonials-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
        .testimonial-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; }
        .stars { color: #f6ad55; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .testimonial-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 18px; line-height: 1.8; }
        .testimonial-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .author-avatar { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a6fb5, #4ecdc4); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
        .author-info .name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a202c; }
        .author-info .loc { font-size: 12px; color: #718096; }

        /* CTA Banner */
        .cta-banner { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a6fb5 0%, #2d8fbb 100%); border-radius: 20px; padding: 56px; text-align: center; margin: 80px auto; max-width: 1200px; }
        .cta-banner h2 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .cta-banner p { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 28px; }
        .cta-banner .btn-light { background: #fff; color: #1a6fb5; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .cta-banner .btn-light:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }

        /* Footer */
        footer { background: #1a202c; color: #a0aec0; padding: 48px 0 24px; }
        .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .footer-brand .logo { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .footer-brand p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #718096; }
        .footer-col h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .footer-col a { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #718096; padding: 4px 0; transition: color 0.2s; }
        .footer-col a:hover { color: #4ecdc4; }
        .footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid #2d3748; padding-top: 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #4a5568; }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero-inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
            .hero-visual { flex: none; width: 100%; max-width: 400px; }
            .hero p { margin: 0 auto 32px; }
            .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }
            .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero { padding: 48px 0; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 30px; }
            .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            nav { display: none; }
            .section { padding: 48px 0; }
            .cta-banner { padding: 36px 24px; margin: 48px 24px; }
            .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container header-inner">
            <div class="logo">
                <div class="logo-icon">洁</div>
                洁家家政
            </div>
            <nav>
                <a href="index.html" class="active">首页</a>
                <a href="services.html">服务项目</a>
                <a href="about.html">关于我们</a>
                <a href="booking.html">在线预约</a>
            </nav>
            <a href="booking.html" class="header-cta">立即预约</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-inner">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <div class="hero-badge">北京本地 · 10年经验 · 持证上岗</div>
                <h1>让专业的人，<br>把家打扫得<span>一尘不染</span></h1>
                <p>洁家家政专注于北京家庭深度保洁、日常清洁及开荒保洁服务。所有保洁师均经过严格培训和背景审查，让您放心把家交给我们。</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="booking.html" class="btn-primary">免费预约体验</a>
                    <a href="services.html" class="btn-secondary">查看服务套餐</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-visual">
                <div class="hero-card">
                    <div class="hero-card-row">
                        <div class="hero-card-icon hc-1">🧹</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="hero-card-label">全屋深度清洁</div>
                            <div class="hero-card-sub">厨房 · 卫生间 · 客厅 · 卧室</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="hero-check">✓</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-card-row">
                        <div class="hero-card-icon hc-2">🪟</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="hero-card-label">玻璃门窗清洗</div>
                            <div class="hero-card-sub">含纱窗 · 窗台 · 轨道</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="hero-check">✓</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-card-row">
                        <div class="hero-card-icon hc-3">🛋️</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="hero-card-label">布艺深度除螨</div>
                            <div class="hero-card-sub">沙发 · 床品 · 窗帘</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="hero-check">✓</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-card-row">
                        <div class="hero-card-icon hc-4">✨</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="hero-card-label">除味消毒处理</div>
                            <div class="hero-card-sub">母婴安全 · 食品级药剂</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="hero-check">✓</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats">
        <div class="container stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>12,600+</h3>
                <p>累计服务家庭</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>98.6%</h3>
                <p>客户满意度</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>86位</h3>
                <p>持证保洁师</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <h3>2小时</h3>
                <p>最快上门响应</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>热门服务项目</h2>
                <p>无论是日常维护还是大扫除，我们都有对应的专业方案</p>
            </div>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon si-1">🏠</div>
                    <h3>日常保洁</h3>
                    <p>适合每周或每两周一次的常规清洁，保持家居整洁如新。含地面擦拭、灰尘清理、厨卫清洁。</p>
                    <div class="service-price">¥199 起 <span>/ 次</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon si-2">🔥</div>
                    <h3>深度大扫除</h3>
                    <p>全屋无死角深度清洁，包括橱柜内部、油烟机拆洗、空调滤网、踢脚线等顽固区域。</p>
                    <div class="service-price">¥499 起 <span>/ 次</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon si-3">🏗️</div>
                    <h3>开荒保洁</h3>
                    <p>新房装修后或新租住入住前的全面清洁，清除建筑粉尘、胶渍、涂料残留等。</p>
                    <div class="service-price">¥8元/㎡ <span>起</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon si-4">🛋️</div>
                    <h3>布艺清洗</h3>
                    <p>沙发、床垫、地毯、窗帘的专业清洗与除螨处理，恢复面料质感与色泽。</p>
                    <div class="service-price">¥299 起 <span>/ 次</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon si-5">🪟</div>
                    <h3>玻璃清洗</h3>
                    <p>内外玻璃、窗框、纱窗、滑轨的精细清洗，适合高层住户和临街户型。</p>
                    <div class="service-price">¥399 起 <span>/ 次</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon si-6">🐾</div>
                    <h3>除螨消毒</h3>
                    <p>使用专业设备对卧室、客厅进行深度除螨和空气消毒，守护家人健康。</p>
                    <div class="service-price">¥349 起 <span>/ 次</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:center; margin-top: 40px;">
                <a href="services.html" class="btn-secondary">查看全部套餐与价格 →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section why-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>为什么选择洁家家政</h2>
                <p>我们把每一单都当作给自家朋友打扫，用心、专业、值得托付</p>
            </div>
            <div class="why-grid">
                <div class="why-visual">
                    <div class="why-visual-text">
                        <span class="big-num">10年</span>
                        <span class="sub">深耕北京家庭清洁市场</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul class="why-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="check">✓</span>
                        <div>
                            <h4>保洁师持证上岗</h4>
                            <p>每位保洁师均持有国家家政服务员职业资格证书，入职前通过背景调查和48小时实操培训。</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="check">✓</span>
                        <div>
                            <h4>标准化服务流程</h4>
                            <p>从进门换鞋、工具消毒到完工验收，全程68项标准化操作，服务效果可追溯。</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="check">✓</span>
                        <div>
                            <h4>不满意免费重做</h4>
                            <p>服务完成后24小时内如对清洁效果不满意，我们免费安排同一位保洁师返工。</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="check">✓</span>
                        <div>
                            <h4>环保安全清洁剂</h4>
                            <p>全部使用母婴安全的食品级清洁用品，无刺鼻气味，对宠物和儿童友好。</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="check">✓</span>
                        <div>
                            <h4>全程保险保障</h4>
                            <p>每次服务均投保家政责任险，如造成物品损坏最高赔付50万元，让您零风险。</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>客户怎么说</h2>
                <p>来自北京各城区真实客户的反馈</p>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonials-grid">
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                    <p>每周三下午固定上门做日常保洁，阿姨特别细致，连冰箱内部和调料瓶后面都擦得干干净净。家里两个小孩跑动，没有味道，用着很安心。</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">刘</div>
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <div class="name">刘女士</div>
                            <div class="loc">海淀区 · 万柳</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                    <p>新房装修完请的开荒保洁，三个人干了整整两天，玻璃上连个指纹都没有，踢脚线的胶印全清掉了。比我自己找散工靠谱太多了。</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">张</div>
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <div class="name">张先生</div>
                            <div class="loc">朝阳区 · 望京</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
                    <p>之前试过好几家，要么中途加价要么干完就走了。洁家的深度保洁确实不一样，油烟机拆下来洗完装回去跟新的一样，价格也透明，没有隐形消费。</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">王</div>
                        <div class="author-info">
                            <div class="name">王女士</div>
                            <div class="loc">西城区 · 金融街</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-banner">
            <h2>第一次预约享8折优惠</h2>
            <p>填写基本信息，我们会在30分钟内电话确认上门时间。无预约门槛，不满意随时取消。</p>
            <a href="booking.html" class="btn-light">立即预约，开启整洁生活</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-grid">
